  "content": "# 死亡動畫\n\n<!---\n  <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/death-animations-data-pack/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?logo=data%3Aimage%2Fwebp%3Bbase64%2CUklGRmYBAABXRUJQVlA4TFoBAAAvP8APEJ%2FAJgCANDjcRHDt34QCWoH5aqgJAKQBbtzb%2Fk3sYgGvraJIkpq5E3C60M%2BfbwYBmfkPAPj%2F78kRNnPJKxVqPkwCMQgq%2FI1Morbke9f%2Fcc5p9Qji1EawYTDAtm2rakNT77bBxv%2F%2FWo6Hg5q2j2tH9H8CUvArNJ36d9a5F2d2dt53ki%2BUOVUHLOZ6PGmVNA3mKClDf9iVdzcdvi%2FFAHe2mh%2FOKOA0envTquspCFwvcwECTMv7VW5ST2f%2BF6y1Uzm4R0lWLv%2B5hsrR6erLWxqkSw3m9aqvMlYPkp6msemeJF1PukoGrvIwX8BsZtMzmE8gm1u5Q8en6cnADJyFgxS0OhvwKBL4gJlTpVsAfMxA3XdMchqbmc2lPoO8b%2BrncmpS7u4%2BdPfKvBOukW6Fqk1Ss1R9shQp%2F37YHe8gdwgxHOw1Kfg8qWEEBKQz1u1GOvENBJ%2BJGIIB&style=for-the-badge&url=https%3A%2F%2Ftschipcraft.ddns.net%2Fmod_resources%2Fendpoint.php%3Fproject%3Ddata-pack%2Fdeath-animations-data-pack\" title=\"PlanetMinecraft Downloads\"></a>\n  -->\n\n> 適用於 Minecraft 1.16x / 1.17x 的資料包！\n\n<details>\n<summary>YouTube 影片</summary>\n⚠ 這些影片展示了此資料包的早期版本。明顯的錯誤多半已修復。<br><br>\n<iframe width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KOcfvcSmKnA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gtLxGX_xePs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rqkheZZQ_dw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe><br><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R54y1E7jK\">bilibili.com 上由蘇打BAKA製作的影片</a>\n</details>\n\n### ⚠ 此資料包目前正在極其緩慢地進行全面重寫，以支援 Minecraft 1.21！[公開測試版本在此](https://github.com/Tschipcraft/deathanimations_test)。\n\n### 如果你喜歡所見內容，歡迎追蹤以在更新準備好時獲得通知！\n\n<h2><img align=\"left\" alt=\"🦴\" width=\"28\" style=\"image-rendering: pixelated\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/misode/mcmeta/refs/heads/assets/assets/minecraft/textures/item/bone.png\"> ‌‌ 功能</h2>\n\n生物死亡時會展現嶄新、_史詩級_的動畫。靈感來自 [iChun 的 Mob Dismemberment 模組](https://ichun.me/mods/mob-dismemberment/)。\n\n**適用於：**\n殭屍、屍殼、骷髏、流髑、苦力怕、沉屍、蜘蛛、洞穴蜘蛛、夜魅、村民、衛道士、喚魔者、幻術師、豬、牛、雞、羊、鐵魔像、劫毀獸和終界蟎。\n\n大多數身體部位可以透過右鍵拾取。\n你還可以在合成台中使用它們，甚至吃掉它們。\n\n## 安裝\n\n安裝方式可選：\n\n* **資料包 [DP]** ➜\n  * 將主資料包 `.zip` 放入你的世界 `datapacks` 資料夾\n  * 將資源包 `.zip` 放入你的 `resourcepack` 資料夾\n  * 在遊戲中啟用資源包\n* **模組 [Mod]** ➜ 放入你的 `mods` 資料夾\n\n若要管理設定，請使用 `/trigger settings`。\n\n## 問題\n\n如果你在 v1.4 中遇到問題，很可能已在重寫版本中修復！  \n如果你在重寫版本中發現問題，歡迎提交問題回報。\n\n## 相容性\n\n<img title=\"支援的 Minecraft 版本\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?not_updated_versions=1.14x,1.15x&untested_versions=1.19x&supported_versions=1.16x,1.17x&total_versions=%3C=1.13x,1.14x,1.15x,1.16x,1.17x,1.18x,1.19x,1.20x,1.21x%3D%3C&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n對於 Minecraft 1.14x 和 1.15x，請使用 [舊版 (Mediafire)](https://www.mediafire.com/folder/o5q5w0qv12ptt/Legacy_(1.14_-_1.15)。  \n正在更新至 Minecraft 1.21x！\n\n## 外部連結\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/data-pack/death-animations-data-pack/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft 標誌\" title=\"在 PlanetMinecraft 上查看\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/en/deathanimations.html\">\n<picture>\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/assets/images/logo-black-1.svg\">\n  <img width=\"40px\" title=\"在我的網站上查看資料包\" src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>",
